Revision history for Perl module Paubox_Email_SDK / Paubox_Forms_SDK

1.4 2026-08-11

    - Added authenticated form-management methods to Paubox_Forms_SDK:
      listForms, getFormById, createForm, updateForm, archiveForm,
      unarchiveForm, copyForm, getFormStats, listFormSubmissions,
      getSubmissionsCsv, getSubmissionPdf.

    - Added scoped API key authentication for the Forms API
      (Authorization: Bearer header). Pass 'apiKey' to
      Paubox_Forms_SDK->new() or set FORMS_API_KEY in config.cfg.
      Keys are generated in the Paubox admin dashboard and must
      include the 'forms' scope. Public getForm/submitForm are
      unchanged and still require no credentials.

    - Extended Paubox_Email_SDK::ApiHelper with callToAPIByPut and a
      responseCode accessor storing the HTTP status of the helper
      instance's last request (used by the CSV/PDF export methods).

    - SECURITY: form and submission ids are now validated and
      percent-encoded before being interpolated into the request path
      (all nine call sites, including the public getForm/submitForm).
      Previously an id containing "/", "?", "#" or ".." could retarget
      a request at a different endpoint while still sending the caller's
      credentials -- and because GET /api/forms/{id} and
      GET /api/forms/{id}/submissions both key their payload on "data",
      a formId of "<uuid>/submissions" satisfied the success-key check,
      so getFormById returned submission records for a call that asked
      for a form definition. Ids containing anything outside
      [A-Za-z0-9_-] now die with a clear message before any request is
      made.

1.3 2024-01-01

    - Added Paubox_Forms_SDK module with getForm and submitForm methods.

    - Updated ApiHelper to conditionally set Authorization header,
      enabling use with public (no-auth) Forms API endpoints.

1.2 2019-07-01
    
    - Added cc property

    - Added changes file
 
1.1 2019-06-05

    - Added force secure notification property.

    - Base64 encoded html content.
 
1.0 2019-04-06

    - Initial release.